# PERFORM (SEL): white 1-5 mute the Drone, the Sequence, the Lead, Sequence 2, the Atmosphere (their levels kept);
# white 7-11 held: Sweep, Open, Shut, Drop (both sequences out), Push; SEL or a page's button leaves
# (on Blasket, AISLING's: both sequences on, Sequence 2 a quieter echo of the first)
wait 500
turn PRESET 4
wait 300
expect piece 4
listen
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
said PERFORM ON
# the Sequence muted (white 2): no note on channel 2
tapkey w1
wait 300
said SEQ
peakreset
wait 6000
expect notes_ch2 0
tapkey w1
wait 300
peakreset
wait 6000
expect notes_ch2 >0
# Drop held (white 10): both sequences out, the Drone goes on
key w9 down
wait 300
peakreset
wait 6000
expect notes_ch2 0
expect notes_ch4 0
key w9 up
wait 300
peakreset
wait 6000
expect notes_ch2 >0
# a page's button leaves PERFORM
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 1
# (0.5) SEL again leaves it too, back to the page it came from: here the Drone's, then its sound page. It says so,
# and the keys are the Lead's again: mutes stay
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 1
said PERFORM OFF
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 8
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 8
# (from the Mix page, D4 held: back to PERFORM's page, not out)
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
key w5 down
wait 200
expect view 7
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
key w5 up
wait 200
expect view 17
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 8
tap ENV
wait 300
# (BERLIN) the keys follow the meters, left to right: white 4 Sequence 2 (the 4th meter), white 5 the Atmosphere (the
# 5th), the other untouched; a solo (black 4: Sequence 2) leaves the Atmosphere out too (Aran, AISLING's: Fire,
# both sequences, Sequence 2 opening over its first 8 bars; Sequence 2 heard: its meter above 2, a moment's reading,
# which caught it at 6 and 9)
turn PRESET -2
wait 6000
expect piece 2
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
tapkey w4
wait 300
said ATMOS
expect mutes 32
wait 3000
expect act4 0
expect act3 >2
tapkey w4
wait 300
tapkey w3
wait 300
said SEQ 2
expect mutes 24
wait 3000
expect act3 0
expect act4 >5
tapkey w3
wait 300
tapkey b3
wait 300
said SOLO
wait 3000
expect act3 >2
expect act4 0
expect act1 0
tapkey b3
wait 3000
expect act4 >5
